    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "If you're interested, be sure to Wishlist the game - that helps a lot!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/803972c7b41b581271f74267fe940ed2.poster.avif?t=1729744734\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/803972c7b41b581271f74267fe940ed2.webm?t=1729744734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/803972c7b41b581271f74267fe940ed2.mp4?t=1729744734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/c6b0625a0b389a68c1361dd8d8231b09.avif?t=1729744734\" /></span><br>It will be a journey from scratch where you'll need to take care of your farm with a lot of hard work while striving to reestablish the city's guild to earn recognition and respect. Throughout this journey, you'll have the opportunity to engage in various exciting adventures and interact with the local residents, each with unique personalities and incredible stories to discover.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/5f495a1ac35b7716afff74abebc86db8.avif?t=1729744734\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MANAGE YOUR OWN FARM</h2>Turn an empty piece of land into a charming farm through planting, harvesting, and animal husbandry! In Rabbit's Fall, our approach to farming is both straightforward and efficient, offering land spaces with up to 9 slots for your various crops. Enjoy an agile and direct process to cultivate your own farm.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/e07f4df5db91940c3e8ea64812b1d2be.poster.avif?t=1729744734\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/e07f4df5db91940c3e8ea64812b1d2be.webm?t=1729744734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/e07f4df5db91940c3e8ea64812b1d2be.mp4?t=1729744734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RESTORE THE GUILD</h2>Rebuild the city's guild by collecting and combining resources, work hard for its restoration, and open the doors for new adventurers to join. Restore the honor and prestige that once made Rabbit's Foot guild a reference and participate in annual tournaments, facing other guilds from the continent to solidify your renown.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/2a9a22048106dd52dc4ca8f22bbd11cf.poster.avif?t=1729744734\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/2a9a22048106dd52dc4ca8f22bbd11cf.webm?t=1729744734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/2a9a22048106dd52dc4ca8f22bbd11cf.mp4?t=1729744734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXERCISE CREATIVITY</h2>Customize your house and turn it into a true cozy home! Leave your unique mark by creating a variety of furniture, decorations, and unique enhancements. Make each room tell your story through special touches that reflect your personality and style.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/10852cd7568c19fdd2c3c53e977dea64.poster.avif?t=1729744734\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/10852cd7568c19fdd2c3c53e977dea64.webm?t=1729744734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/10852cd7568c19fdd2c3c53e977dea64.mp4?t=1729744734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BE PART OF THE COMMUNITY</h2>Welcome to the captivating community of Whale Harbor! Here, you'll find a gallery of memorable characters, each with distinct personalities, engaging routines, and captivating stories to share. Explore the richness of their lives and who knows, maybe even discover the spark of romance in the air? Join in seasonal and yearly events. Join us in uncovering the wonders that Whale Harbor has to offer.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/4fdab57c01d41ac379e2cc5de71411ea.poster.avif?t=1729744734\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/4fdab57c01d41ac379e2cc5de71411ea.webm?t=1729744734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/4fdab57c01d41ac379e2cc5de71411ea.mp4?t=1729744734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIND A SPECIAL SOMEONE</h2>Meet the singles who are in search of love! Build relationships, find the right person, and win their heart; take them on dates. And when you prefer, start a new chapter of your story, build a family, have children, and watch them grow alongside your partner.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/bfe58dc987e7faeec4a67c44d345d84e.poster.avif?t=1729744734\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/bfe58dc987e7faeec4a67c44d345d84e.webm?t=1729744734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/bfe58dc987e7faeec4a67c44d345d84e.mp4?t=1729744734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE WORLD</h2>Enter the city of Whale Harbor and immerse yourself in its history, uncovering its hidden secrets. Discover the fate of the great hero and unravel the events that led to the fall of Rabbit's Foot Guild. Additionally, various dungeons await you nearby, each with its own puzzles to be solved.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/f43ad6a72d3e0eb493575dbe672c3a9e.poster.avif?t=1729744734\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/f43ad6a72d3e0eb493575dbe672c3a9e.webm?t=1729744734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/f43ad6a72d3e0eb493575dbe672c3a9e.mp4?t=1729744734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE YOUR CLASS</h2>Embark on your adventures as a relentless <strong>Mage</strong>, perhaps an exceptionally skilled <strong>Swordsman</strong>. Maybe you'll embody a rock-solid <strong>Crusader</strong>, a wise and virtuous <strong>Cleric</strong>, or a cunning and stealthy <strong>Thief</strong>. Regardless of your class, your journey will be epic.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/f4ecf2a34a15ad7be590c0c2a4b21689.avif?t=1729744734\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BATTLE AND CONQUER</h2>Confront the remnants of the Demon King that roam uncontested throughout the continent, supported by your valiant guild companions. Challenge formidable creatures, enter the mysterious dungeons surrounding Whale Harbor, explore every corner of them, and triumph over the formidable bosses guarding the floors. Elevate your group and guild's reputation, achieving victories that will echo throughout the land.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/d45670f67148523fc87d7ff3be3f75d5.poster.avif?t=1729744734\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/d45670f67148523fc87d7ff3be3f75d5.webm?t=1729744734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/d45670f67148523fc87d7ff3be3f75d5.mp4?t=1729744734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY WITH FRIENDS</h2>The game was designed from the ground up with a focus on multiplayer mode, allowing a maximum of 4 players. Players will have complete freedom to embark on their own adventures, purchase properties, build relationships, form their own teams, and much more. There will be no need to rely solely on the game host, as each player will have the autonomy to carry out their actions and progress individually.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/d61c41b64bbc6f0152be461dd8ac5f19.poster.avif?t=1729744734\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/d61c41b64bbc6f0152be461dd8ac5f19.webm?t=1729744734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/d61c41b64bbc6f0152be461dd8ac5f19.mp4?t=1729744734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "If you're interested, be sure to Wishlist the game - that helps a lot!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/803972c7b41b581271f74267fe940ed2.poster.avif?t=1729744734\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/803972c7b41b581271f74267fe940ed2.webm?t=1729744734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/803972c7b41b581271f74267fe940ed2.mp4?t=1729744734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/c6b0625a0b389a68c1361dd8d8231b09.avif?t=1729744734\" /></span><br>It will be a journey from scratch where you'll need to take care of your farm with a lot of hard work while striving to reestablish the city's guild to earn recognition and respect. Throughout this journey, you'll have the opportunity to engage in various exciting adventures and interact with the local residents, each with unique personalities and incredible stories to discover.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/5f495a1ac35b7716afff74abebc86db8.avif?t=1729744734\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MANAGE YOUR OWN FARM</h2>Turn an empty piece of land into a charming farm through planting, harvesting, and animal husbandry! In Rabbit's Fall, our approach to farming is both straightforward and efficient, offering land spaces with up to 9 slots for your various crops. Enjoy an agile and direct process to cultivate your own farm.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap