e_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/10852cd7568c19fdd2c3c53e977dea64.webm?t=1729744734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/10852cd7568c19fdd2c3c53e977dea64.mp4?t=1729744734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BE PART OF THE COMMUNITY</h2>Welcome to the captivating community of Whale Harbor! Here, you'll find a gallery of memorable characters, each with distinct personalities, engaging routines, and captivating stories to share. Explore the richness of their lives and who knows, maybe even discover the spark of romance in the air? Join in seasonal and yearly events. Join us in uncovering the wonders that Whale Harbor has to offer.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/4fdab57c01d41ac379e2cc5de71411ea.poster.avif?t=1729744734\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/4fdab57c01d41ac379e2cc5de71411ea.webm?t=1729744734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/4fdab57c01d41ac379e2cc5de71411ea.mp4?t=1729744734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIND A SPECIAL SOMEONE</h2>Meet the singles who are in search of love! Build relationships, find the right person, and win their heart; take them on dates. And when you prefer, start a new chapter of your story, build a family, have children, and watch them grow alongside your partner.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extras/bfe58dc987e7faeec4a67c44d345d84e.poster.avif?t=1729744734\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2552240/extra